{"unit_id":"tag:0H8I:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是域（field）扩张（extension）。则态射（morphism）<MATH_0002>在<MATH_0003>上是支配（dominant）的，当且仅当拉回（pullback）<MATH_0004>是支配（dominant）的。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"dominant","target_term":"支配"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"dominant","target_term":"支配"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域","context":"域扩张；待决。"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张","context":"域扩张；待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"基域上的态射；待决。"},{"source_term":"dominant","target_term":"支配","context":"态射性质；待决。"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回","context":"域扩张下的拉回；待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0H8I:proof","translation":"由《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0001>，态射（morphism）<MATH_0001>是普遍开（universally open）的。因此<MATH_0002>是开（open）的。所以，若<MATH_0003>是支配（dominant）的，则《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0002>给出<MATH_0004>是支配（dominant）的。反之，假设<MATH_0005>是支配（dominant）的。态射（morphism）<MATH_0006>是满射（surjective）的，见《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0003>，所以复合（composition）<MATH_0007>是支配（dominant）的。这也是复合（composition）<MATH_0008>，所以<MATH_0009>是支配（dominant）的。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"universally open","target_term":"普遍开"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开"},{"source_term":"dominant","target_term":"支配"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"dominant","target_term":"支配"},{"source_term":"dominant","target_term":"支配"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"dominant","target_term":"支配"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"dominant","target_term":"支配"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"引用章名；待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"证明中的态射；待决。"},{"source_term":"universally open","target_term":"普遍开","context":"结构态射性质；待决。"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开","context":"基底态射性质；待决。"},{"source_term":"dominant","target_term":"支配","context":"支配性的下降；待决。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"基底态射性质；待决。"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合","context":"态射复合；待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:02KW:proof","translation":"普遍单射（injective）态射（morphism）的基变换（base change）是普遍单射（injective）的（这是形式性的）。普遍单射（injective）这一性质在基底（base）上是 Zariski 局部（local）的；这由定义即清楚。最后，设<MATH_0001>是仿射概形（affine schemes）之间的平坦（flat）满射（surjective）态射（morphism），并设<MATH_0002>是一个态射（morphism）。假设基变换（base change）<MATH_0003>是普遍单射（injective）的。设<MATH_0004>是一个域（field），并设<MATH_0005>是两个态射（morphisms），使得<MATH_0006>。由于<MATH_0007>是满射（surjective）的，且根据《概形（Schemes）》第<REF_0001>节的讨论，存在域（field）扩张（extension）<MATH_0008>和态射（morphism）<MATH_0009>，使得以下实线图（diagram）交换（commutes）：<MATH_0010>。由于方块是笛卡尔（cartesian）的，得到两个虚线箭头<MATH_0011>、<MATH_0012>，使图（diagram）交换（commute）。由于<MATH_0013>是普遍单射（injective）的，得到<MATH_0014>，见《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0002>。显然，这迫使<MATH_0015>（由《概形（Schemes）》第<REF_0003>节的讨论）。所以引理<REF_0004>适用，结论得证。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n另一种证明可利用以下刻画：普遍单射（injective）态射（morphism）恰是对角态射（diagonal）为满射（surjective）的态射，见《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0005>。于是本引理由满射（surjective）这一性质在基底（base）上是 fpqc 局部（local）的这一事实得到，见引理<REF_0006>。（提示：利用对角态射（diagonal）的基变换（base change）是基变换（base change）的对角态射（diagonal）这一事实。）\n","allowed_english":["Zariski","fpqc"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"base","target_term":"基底"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"sou